# Built packages
*.nupkg

# Downloaded binaries (fetched at install time, never committed)
**/tools/*.exe

# Chocolatey logs
*.log
# ...but keep the automation's push history (committed by the workflow)
!logs/pushed-versions.log

# Design specs, plans and reports stay local (see AGENTS.md). No trailing slash:
# in a checkout it is a symbolic link, which a directory-only pattern does not match.
docs/superpowers
